# Safety and Privacy Rule

Authoritative source: `docs/SAFETY_POLICY.md`, summarised in `CLAUDE.md`
("The rules that matter most here").

Never guarantee safety, claim the app contacted anyone, impersonate police or
dispatch, diagnose, expose precise locations or contact details, or let a model
decide whether a situation is an emergency.
